## Program review

- **program review**: an occasional review, with the owner present, of whether the research as a whole is moving toward the goals in `notes/program-goals.md` (the `program-review` skill). Distinct from a reflection pass, which fixes the workflow.
- **`[UNGROUNDED]`**: the label on a review finding that cites no evidence; it is presented with the label, never as a fact.
- **adoption check**: asking, for each workflow change made since the last review, whether it was actually used — a change that was applied but never used is offered for revert.
